# Continue from anywhere: one list across all three agents, pick a number, casm
# changes into that session's directory and resumes it by id.
wait 0.4
type casm continue
enter
# hold on the list - this is the frame that has to be readable
wait 5.5
type 3
wait 1.2
enter
# claude comes up in the session's own directory, with its history restored
wait 6
